# Copy to .env.local (dev) or set in Hostinger → Node.js app → Environment
# variables (production). Never commit real credentials.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- quote mail
# Two emails go out per instant quote on /quote: the customer's copy of the
# quotation, and the shipping-quote request to the office. Without SMTP_USER
# and SMTP_PASS the route still returns a quote — it just logs the email to the
# server console instead of sending it, and the browser tells the customer so
# and offers WhatsApp/email instead.
#
# Values below are Hostinger's (docs/EMAIL-MIGRATION.md §"Client
# configuration"). Port 465 is implicit TLS; 587 with STARTTLS also works.
# Reminder: the plan caps a mailbox at 100 sends per 24 hours, and this costs
# two per quote — roughly 50 quotes a day.
SMTP_HOST=smtp.hostinger.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=admin@tinyhomesa.com
SMTP_PASS=

# Optional. Defaults to "Tiny Homes SA website <SMTP_USER>". Must stay on the
# authenticated mailbox or SPF/DKIM will fail — the customer goes in Reply-To.
# SMTP_FROM="Tiny Homes SA website <admin@tinyhomesa.com>"

# Optional. Where shipping-quote requests land. Defaults to admin@tinyhomesa.com.
# QUOTE_NOTIFY_EMAIL=admin@tinyhomesa.com

# ----------------------------------------------------- showroom viewings
# /book-a-viewing reads the owner's iCloud calendar to work out which
# half-hour slots are genuinely free, and writes the confirmed viewing back
# into it. Without these the page does not guess: it tells visitors to phone.
#
# ICLOUD_APP_PASSWORD is an APP-SPECIFIC password, never the Apple ID password.
# Generate one at appleid.apple.com → Sign-In and Security → App-Specific
# Passwords. It is scoped to this integration alone and can be revoked there
# without disturbing anything else. See docs/SHOWROOM-BOOKINGS.md.
ICLOUD_APPLE_ID=
ICLOUD_APP_PASSWORD=

# Optional. Which calendar to read and write, by its name in Apple Calendar.
# Defaults to the account's first event calendar, which is usually "Home" —
# set this explicitly if viewings should live somewhere else. Anything on
# OTHER calendars (subscribed holidays, birthdays, a shared family calendar)
# is invisible to the availability check, so keep real commitments here.
# ICLOUD_CALENDAR_NAME=Work

# Optional. Where the office copy of a booking lands. Falls back to
# QUOTE_NOTIFY_EMAIL, then admin@tinyhomesa.com.
# QUOTE_NOTIFY_EMAIL=admin@tinyhomesa.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 3D models
MESHY_API_KEY=
